    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<h2>Improvised Engineer</h2><p><em>If you can’t fix it, you can at least make it dangerous.</em></p><hr /><h3>Rules</h3><p>You gain a rank in Tinkering (artisan’s tools). If you already have it, its rank rises by one instead.</p><p>During a Scene Break, you can craft one improvised device from scrap (choose one):</p><ul><li><strong>Flash-burn:</strong> A thrown device (20/60) that sheds bright light in a 2 squares radius for 1 minute; creatures that rely on invisibility have their invisibility suppressed while in the light (GM adjudication).</li><li><strong>Snareline:</strong> A 2 squares tripline trap you can set in 1 minute; the first creature to cross it must succeed on a Intrigue check (DC = 8 + your rank bonus + your Mind value) or fall prone.</li><li><strong>Signal Screamer:</strong> A noisemaker you can place; it triggers on contact, audible out to 60 squares</li></ul><p>A device becomes inert after 8 hours or after triggering once.</p><p class=\"ft-engine-note\"><em>⚙ +1 Tinkering. 🃏 Card — the device is built by hand.</em></p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
